---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="QR Payment Services - SkanPay"
  description="Review the practical SkanPay service areas around QR checkout readiness, coupon or voucher redemption, merchant confirmation, and partner integration planning."
  activePath="/services/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1>QR checkout planning for payment teams</h1>
    <p>SkanPay service conversations focus on the checkout request, buyer approval, redemption path, and merchant-facing result.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="grid two">
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Checkout request mapping</h3>
        <p>Define the amount, merchant reference, buyer review screen, and final result.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>QR request structure</h3>
        <p>Clarify what the QR request needs to carry across apps and checkout systems.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Status and timeout behavior</h3>
        <p>Plan pending, approved, cancelled, expired, failed, and completed states.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Partner app participation</h3>
        <p>Identify where a wallet, payment app, loyalty app, or commerce app participates.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Redemption coordination</h3>
        <p>Map where offers, vouchers, rewards, or stored value affect checkout.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card route-card">
        <span>06</span>
        <h3>Existing processor alignment</h3>
        <p>Frame SkanPay around existing processor, acquirer, and POS relationships.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Next step</p>
      <h2>Use the Technology page for the state model.</h2>
      <p>For a specific merchant or partner use case, contact SkanPay.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button secondary" href="/qr-payments/">View Technology</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
